                                    </item>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg132">Interest of the United States in a
                                            regional alliance of East Asian and Pacific powers;
                                            negotiation of a mutual defense treaty with the
                                            Philippines and a security treaty with Australia and New
                                            Zealand</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Australia</hi>: <list>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg266">United States relations with
                                            Australia</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
