                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">The China Area</hi>: <list>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg331">United States relations with the
                                            Republic of China: policies toward the People’s Republic
                                            of China</ref>
                                    </item>
                                </list>
                            </item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Indochina</hi>: <list>
                                    <item>
                                        <ref target="#pg332">Policy of the United States with
